{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00871-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["캐나다는 이 사고에 직접적 지분이 있다","미국의 보잉사(社)가 제조한 737-800"],"reason":"The summary says Canada has no direct stake, but the source says Canada does have a direct stake. This reverses the meaning. It also leaves out the 1988 shootdown, which is the central explanation for why the US raised the shootdown possibility.","},"B":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["미국은 이란과의 관계에서 88년을 잊지 못한다","당시 이란의 민간항공기를 미국 해군 이지스함이 이란의 전투기로 오인해 격추시켰기 때문이다"],"reason":"The summary ends with the garbled sentence '1988년 당시 이란과의 관계에서 88년을 잊지 못한다'. It never explains what happened in 1988, so the key reasoning is missing. It also copies the source's lead sentence nearly verbatim.","},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["캐나다는 이 사고에 직접적 지분이 있다","답은 1988년에 있다"],"reason":"The summary states that Canada had no direct stake, which contradicts the source. It also omits the 1988 background, which is the main point of the article. The rest of the summary is accurate.","},"D":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["캐나다는 이 사고에 직접적 지분이 있다","290은 88년 미국의 이란 항공기 격추로 사망한 이란 국민의 숫자다"],"reason":"The summary says Canada has no direct stake, which contradicts the source. It calls 290 'the number of the crashed Iranian aircraft', when the source says it is the number of Iranians killed. It also includes garbled phrasing about 88년 and never explains the 1988 shootdown.","}}}
